    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "Ticket for release preparations of Cython 3.4.\n\nPlanned features:\n- freethreading compatible stable ABI\n- improved isolated module state handling (global cdefs in the module state is the main thing we're missing, but there's a number of other improvements)",
