        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I suspect 3.4 is quite a way off yet, but my current objectives for it are:\n* freethreading compatible stable ABI\n* improved isolated module state handling (global cdefs in the module state is the main thing we're missing, but there's a number of other improvements)\n\nI think in both cases (and the overlappping case) there's some existing code we won't be able to support. I think this is fine provided there's usable diagnostics about it.",
            "created_at": "2026-11-01T10:20:05Z",
